      "modify_to": "Use post_button_target to identify the purple ring underneath the released instructed-color cube in the saved frame, or the first frame if the value is a list. For a list, follow that same ring through the saved shuffle frames to its final settled position; its release-time position is not necessarily its final position. Match the ring's final position to the current scene using the button and final ring layout. This is the destination, even if another ring is closer to the cube. Ignore cubes of other colors."
